@table tab:onesite | The one-site kernel $\theta_{kl}(a)=c_{kl}\,a^{k+l-\lambda_2-1}$: coefficients $c_{kl}$ from the closed form (eq.~\ref{eq:ckl}) for all two-row (and one-row) representations up to $\lambda_1=4$. Pairs $(kl)$ in lexicographic order, $0\le k<l\le\lambda_1+1$, $l\ge\lambda_2+1$. The entries for $\Lambda\le[4,2,0]$ coincide with the exact one-site fits of G1; the rest were predicted by the formula and then confirmed (17 representations in all).
